{"id": "t052-053", "text": "Ben - wedding date set!! 22 August 2027, Cornwall. Jasmine's not invited apparently - awkward", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22 August 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t052-054", "text": "Gareth - lost the darts final Fri, 5-4 in the last leg, gutted. wife Mei says he's been sulking all wkend + hasn't touched the board since. she reckons a new set of darts wd cheer him up, his are 15 yrs old. take him for a pint this wk + maybe go halves w Mei on the darts", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "darts final", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sulking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all wkend"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "new set of darts wd cheer him up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this wk", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go halves w Mei on the darts", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}]}
